message: "If you use VTL in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Visual Thinking Lens: deterministic structural measurement for images"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Parrish
    given-names: Russell
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0008-9781-7995
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-21
license: MIT
url: https://www.parallaxmetrology.com
repository-code: https://github.com/parallaxmetrology/visual-thinking-lens
keywords:
  - composition
  - spatial priors
  - generative models
  - image evaluation
abstract: >
  A deterministic, model-free instrument that measures the spatial organization of
  visual mass in an image (placement, void, packing, cohesion, peripheral pull,
  orientation, thickness, dispersion), with companion color/value and radial
  compliance kernels and corpus-level fingerprints for comparing generators and makers.
